{"sectionId":"thermo/first-law","items":[{"id":"thermo--first-law-k001","sectionId":"thermo/first-law","unitId":"thermo","subject":"chemistry","text":"화학 부호 규약에서 ΔU=q+w이며 계가 일을 받으면 w>0, PV 일은 w=−∫Pext dV이다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"thermo--first-law-k002","sectionId":"thermo/first-law","unitId":"thermo","subject":"chemistry","text":"내부에너지 U와 엔탈피 H=U+PV는 상태함수이며 열과 일은 경로함수다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"thermo--first-law-k003","sectionId":"thermo/first-law","unitId":"thermo","subject":"chemistry","text":"일정 압력에서 PV 일만 고려하면 qp=ΔH, 일정 부피에서는 qv=ΔU이다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"thermo--first-law-k004","sectionId":"thermo/first-law","unitId":"thermo","subject":"chemistry","text":"이상기체 반응에서 같은 온도에 ΔH=ΔU+Δn_gRT를 사용할 수 있다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"thermo--first-law-k005","sectionId":"thermo/first-law","unitId":"thermo","subject":"chemistry","text":"열량 q=mcΔT는 상변화가 없고 비열 일정 근사에서 성립한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"thermo--first-law-k006","sectionId":"thermo/first-law","unitId":"thermo","subject":"chemistry","text":"Hess 법칙은 상태함수인 엔탈피 변화가 경로와 무관함을 이용한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"thermo--first-law-k007","sectionId":"thermo/first-law","unitId":"thermo","subject":"chemistry","text":"표준 반응엔탈피 ΔH°=ΣνΔHf°(생성물)−ΣνΔHf°(반응물)이다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"thermo--first-law-k008","sectionId":"thermo/first-law","unitId":"thermo","subject":"chemistry","text":"표준 상태의 안정한 원소 형태의 ΔHf°는 0으로 정의한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"thermo--first-law-k009","sectionId":"thermo/first-law","unitId":"thermo","subject":"chemistry","text":"평균 결합엔탈피로 기체 반응을 근사할 때 끊는 결합 에너지 합에서 생성 결합 에너지 합을 뺀다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"thermo--first-law-k010","sectionId":"thermo/first-law","unitId":"thermo","subject":"chemistry","text":"발열 반응은 ΔH<0, 흡열은 ΔH>0이다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"thermo--first-law-k011","sectionId":"thermo/first-law","unitId":"thermo","subject":"chemistry","text":"계 기준 발열 q<0.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"thermo--first-law-k012","sectionId":"thermo/first-law","unitId":"thermo","subject":"chemistry","text":"폭발열량계는 일정 부피, 커피컵 열량계는 일정 압력 근사.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"thermo--first-law-k013","sectionId":"thermo/first-law","unitId":"thermo","subject":"chemistry","text":"반응식을 역으로 쓰면 ΔH 부호 반전, 계수를 k배 하면 ΔH도 k배.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"thermo--first-law-k014","sectionId":"thermo/first-law","unitId":"thermo","subject":"chemistry","text":"열량계와 반응계의 열교환 부호는 반대다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"thermo--first-law-k015","sectionId":"thermo/first-law","unitId":"thermo","subject":"chemistry","text":"−20 kJ이다.","kind":"review-answer","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]}]}